# into this file.
# Since 2026-11-07 Stranglethorn's second loop, after Desolace (the first loop is 30-40/04, which takes its Booty Bay
# quests). In from Duskwood at the north, down through the jungle, out at Booty Bay.

step Collin Mauren
  when complete 1078
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 1078                         -- In the Slaughtered Lamb, if you still carry it

step Fly to Darkshire
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  fly "Darkshire"
  zone Duskwood

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 40.8,4.2 "Into Stranglethorn Vale"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip From Duskwood take the road south; the camp sits in the hills west of the road.
  accept 207                          -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 574                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 210                          -- Corporal Kaleb: for Krazek in Booty Bay

step Bookie Herod
  when onquest 200
  tip Herod's records lie in a hut on the west side of Kurzen's Compound, east of the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 200                          -- Bookie Herod's Records, upstairs
  accept 328

step Kurzen's Compound
  tip Headshrinkers stand deeper in the compound; the Commandos lurk stealthed around it and in the cave, and Herod's strongbox sits by the cave mouth. Pick up Green Hills pages as they drop.
  tip Careful: Kurzen Commandos are level 34-35, not elite, and often spawn stealthed; near death they use Smoke Bomb.
  kill 938 quest 574.1 @46.3,7.8 map 1434 -- Kurzen Commando
  kill 941 quest 574.2 @46.4,7.9 map 1434 -- Kurzen Headshrinker, below ground
  turnin 328                          -- Bookie Herod's Strongbox, below ground
  accept 329

step Rebel Camp
  turnin 329                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  accept 330
  turnin 330                          -- Corporal Sethman
  accept 331
  turnin 331                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  turnin 574                          -- Sergeant Yohwa: the Commandos and Headshrinkers fell in the compound

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip South along the road: the hunters' tents stand just west of it.
  accept 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin

step The jungle ruins
  tip Loop through the troll ruins of the north and centre: each holds one stone tablet of the troll legends. Shadowmaw Panthers prowl stealthed in the jungle around them; the Venture Co. camp on Lake Nazferiti carries the Tumbled Crystals.
  collect 2005 quest 207.1            -- The First Troll Legend: Moon Over the Vale
  collect 2006 quest 207.2            -- The Second Troll Legend: Gri'lek the Wanderer; underwater

step Water Elementals
  tip Follow the west coast north to the haunted island off the shore west of Nesingwary's camp: the Lesser Water Elementals rise from the water around it.
  collect 3923 quest 601              -- Water Elemental Bracers

step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  collect 2007 quest 207.3            -- The Third Troll Legend: Fall of Gurubashi
  collect 2008 quest 207.4            -- The Fourth Troll Legend: The Emperor's Tomb
  collect 4106 quest 213              -- Tumbled Crystal
  kill 684 quest 192                  -- Shadowmaw Panther
  complete 339 optional               -- Chapter I
  complete 340 optional               -- Chapter II
  complete 341 optional               -- Chapter III
  complete 342 optional               -- Chapter IV

