step Nesingwary's Expedition
  when group 193
  accept 193

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South

step Snapjaw Crocolisks
  tip Snapjaw Crocolisks bask along the river in the middle of the jungle, on the way south to the Skullsplitter ruins.
  collect 4104 quest 577              -- Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin

step Level 36
  when level<36
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Troll Witchery's Skullsplitter trolls are 39-42. Below 36? Keep killing the Snapjaw Crocolisks along the river until level 36. Or, with a group, run the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Armory) or the Razorfen Downs dungeon instead.
  goto 40.2,27.2 map 1434 "Snapjaw Crocolisk"
  level 36 grind 1152                 -- grind on Snapjaw Crocolisk

step Skullsplitter trolls
  tip The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins east of the road between Nesingwary and Grom'gol.
  collect 2466 quest 205              -- Skullsplitter Fetish

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  turnin 577                          -- Drizzlik, inside
  turnin 601                          -- Baron Revilgaz, upstairs in the tavern
  accept 602                          -- For Archmage Ansirem in Alterac Mountains
  turnin 213                          -- Kebok
  turnin 210                          -- Krazek, upstairs
